## 5. SCUTTLEBUTT & RESEARCH METHODS

### 5.1 What They DON'T Do

| Don't Use | Reason |
|-----------|--------|
| Wall Street analyst reports | Conflict of interest, groupthink |
| Macroeconomic forecasts | Impossible to predict |
| Computer screening programs | Can't assess qualitative factors |
| Complex spreadsheets | False precision is dangerous |

### 5.2 What They DO

**Massive reading:**
- Annual reports
- 10-Ks
- Trade magazines
- Value Line charts
- Competitor filings

**The "Scuttlebutt" method (from Phil Fisher):**
- Talk to competitors
- Talk to ex-employees
- Talk to suppliers
- Talk to customers
- Talk to industry executives

```mermaid
